Source: qdgc
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/ragnvald/qdgc

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-qdgc
Architecture: all
Provides: postgresql-qdgc
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: postgresql-PGVERSION-postgis-3
Description: Extended Quarter Degree Grid Cell codes for PostgreSQL
 qdgc implements Extended Quarter Degree Grid Cell encoding, decoding, and
 navigation in pure SQL. It also includes an optional PostGIS bridge.
